# Template for the codefix `Dev` sandbox env_file.
#
#   cp base.env.example secrets/base.env   # secrets/ is gitignored — never commit the real one
#
# This file is injected into the sandbox as environment variables at run time. Which vars you
# need depends on --sandbox; see README "Run it locally". Lines are KEY=VALUE; no ${VAR}
# interpolation yet (values are literal), so the token/key below are written in plain.

# --- model auth (claude-code) ---
# Required for --sandbox docker (the image carries no creds). For --sandbox local you may omit
# this if Claude OAuth creds are reachable via HOME (~/.claude/.credentials.json).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- git auth ---
# Only needed if you are NOT using a GitHub App (`loopy auth github` injects a scoped token
# automatically on run + trigger). A classic/fine-grained PAT with contents:write +
# pull_requests:write on the target repo. The sandbox git reads it for github.com.
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...

# --- only for --sandbox local (bare subprocess inherits nothing from your shell) ---
# Uncomment and set so `claude`/`git` resolve and ~/.gitconfig + OAuth creds are found.
# With --sandbox docker these come from the image — leave them out.
# PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
# HOME=/home/you
